INFO:agent.loop:\u26a1 Executing tool: 'knowledge_agent' with arguments: {"source_title": "Ronin and Harmony Horizon public attribution and blockchain analysis", "source_url": "SRC-001; SRC-002; SRC-003", "text": "Benchmark sources report: Elliptic says the FBI confirmed Lazarus Group, backed by North Korea, behind the June 24 2022 Harmony Horizon Bridge hack of $99.7m; Elliptic says attribution was based partly on similarities to Lazarus laundering patterns. Harmony funds were programmatically structured through Tornado Cash, mirroring Ronin laundering. Elliptic estimates more than $555m from the two hacks passed through Tornado Cash: over $468m from Ronin and $96m from Harmony. After Tornado Cash sanctions, Harmony funds were structured through Railgun; about 70% of funds sent through Railgun were estimated to be Harmony funds, and post-Railgun funds went to three exchanges, with Binance and Huobi identifying, blocking and seizing some. Elliptic's Ronin source reports March 2022 theft of 173,600 ETH and 25.5m USDC, worth $540m at theft; OFAC on April 14 2022 sanctioned the thief Ethereum address and listed its owner as Lazarus Group. Ronin postmortem said attacker obtained five of nine validator private keys, likely via social engineering. Elliptic reported 18% laundered by Apr 14: USDC swapped for ETH on DEXs; $16.7m ETH through three centralized exchanges; after exchanges announced cooperation, attacker used Tornado Cash; $80.3m ETH sent through Tornado Cash; $9.7m in intermediary wallets; $433m remained in original wallet. Chainalysis reports Lazarus gained five of nine Ronin validator keys, withdrew 173,600 ETH and 25.5m USDC, and used over 12,000 addresses. It describes a typical North Korea-linked DeFi laundering sequence: intermediary wallets, Tornado Cash mixing, ETH-to-BTC swaps, Bitcoin mixing, crypto-to-fiat cashout; also chain-hopping via ETH to BNB, swap to USDD, bridge to BitTorrent. Chainalysis says more than $30m was seized with law enforcement and industry cooperation. The available benchmark evidence does not establish an APT38 alias/equivalence or provide specific wallet addresses beyond the Ronin thief address being sanctioned; do not infer that linkage."}
